    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447560/extras/d3ee90ab0b73bb5b31e2b586bf51d2a3.poster.avif?t=1740168944\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447560/extras/d3ee90ab0b73bb5b31e2b586bf51d2a3.webm?t=1740168944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447560/extras/d3ee90ab0b73bb5b31e2b586bf51d2a3.mp4?t=1740168944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your dream chicken store business solo or co-op with up to 6 players. Join a game from the lobby or open your single-player session to play together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the chicken shop fast food running smoothly, you'll operate fryers, grills, serve customers etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to keep customers happy and the chicken shop line moving smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own Chicken Store Restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve Customers, Cook Chicken, Manage Business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure smooth operation of customers and keep them satisfied </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo or Co-Op with friends or public lobbies with up to 6 players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken Store fast-food simulator gameplay</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your dream chicken store business solo or co-op with up to 6 players. Join a game from the lobby or open your single-player session to play together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the chicken shop fast food running smoothly, you'll operate fryers, grills, serve customers etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to keep customers happy and the chicken shop line moving smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own Chicken Store Restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve Customers, Cook Chicken, Manage Business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure smooth operation of customers and keep them satisfied </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo or Co-Op with friends or public lobbies with up to 6 players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken Store fast-food simulator gameplay</p></li></ul>",
